  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Public Private Infrastructure Advisory Facility</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Public Private Infrastructure Advisory Facility is a component of Support to the Public Private Infrastructure Advisory Facility (PPIAF), a multi donor facility aimed at supporting governments attract private sector investment in infrastructure (water and sanitation, energy, telecommunications and irrigation) reported by FCDO with a funding type of 109 - Multilateral organisation and a budget of &#xa3;10,335,000. This project benefits Developing countries, unspecified. It works in the following sector(s): Communications policy and administrative management, Transport policy and administrative management, Energy policy and administrative management, Privatisation, Water sector policy and administrative management, Environmental policy and administrative management, Business policy and administration.</narrative>
  </description>
